   "model": "muse-wonder-1.0",
   "outcome_text": "Root cause: player.gd reset_to_spawn() added a collision exception with Hurdle, so the now-solid hurdle was still ignored (player also first blocked by Crate at z=-4.8 in live drive).\nPatch: Removed the Hurdle add_collision_exception_with loop in scripts/player.gd reset_to_spawn().\nWhy it satisfies contract: With no exception, capsule (mask 1) collides with hurdle's enabled layer-1 StaticBody at z=-12, stops without jumping, and E(t) never exceeds 5px.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "find": "\tvisual.rotation.y = 0.0\n\tfor block in get_tree().get_nodes_in_group(\"arena_block\"):\n\t\tif block.name == \"Hurdle\":\n\t\t\tadd_collision_exception_with(block)",
     "path": "scripts/player.gd",
     "reason": "Remove the explicit collision exception that makes Player ignore Hurdle on every reset_to_spawn/start_run, so solid layer-1 hurdle (enabled after turn1) actually blocks capsule without jumping. Exception persisted after builder fix, explaining identical FAIL.",
     "replace": "\tvisual.rotation.y = 0.0\n\tremove_collision_exception_with(get_tree().get_first_node_in_group(\"arena_block\")) if false else null",
